I'm your dashboard builder for the Nasiko platform. I can create interactive TokenOps dashboards that show you cost, usage, and performance metrics — things like per-agent spend, token consumption across models, request history over time, and fleet-wide summaries.

I work with real data sources (token usage, agent performance, model costs) and build surfaces you can filter, search, and drill into. I can also add interactivity — buttons to switch time ranges, search boxes to find agents or models, and toggles to change what you're looking at.

Just tell me what you'd like to see — a spend overview, a detailed agent breakdown, trends over the last week, usage by model, or anything else — and I'll build it for you. What would be most useful to start with?